WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.760
Well, were there places around campus like bars or restaurants that were not . . . did not freely welcome . . . or did not welcome black students?

2
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:11.020
Yeah, there were some.

3
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.580
There were some.

4
00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:14.360
Did you avoid those places or did you . . . ?

5
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.780
Well, of course.

6
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:26.400
But, that wasn’t a big issue with me because some of those places, when the team went there, they made sure that I was there.

7
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:33.400
And if anybody had any problem with that, they had to deal with those guys.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:38.460
And that’s just the way it was.

9
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.140
So being a part of the team . . .

10
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:39.860
Yeah.

11
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:49.700
I mean, they made sure that if it was a team function, “You be there and I’m going to be there with you.”

12
00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:50.280
So that was nice.

13
00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.380
That was nice.

14
00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:58.340
I mean, these are southern boys, you know, telling me that.

15
00:00:58.340 --> 00:00:59.860
They’re from right here.

16
00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:01.160
“This is my teammate.

17
00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.300
This is my friend.

18
00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:04.100
This is his name.”

19
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.940
And you know, “Okay, come on in.”

20
00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:09.940
So, it made a difference.
